# ── Security declarations ─────────────────────────
# Key Management [private_dc]: K8s Secrets encrypted at rest with platform KMS; external vault synchronization; automated rotation; no hardcoded credentials
# Key Management [aws]: Peer-owned AWS KMS and Secrets Manager; short-lived credentials at the integration boundary
# Key Management [azure]: Peer-owned Azure Key Vault and managed identity; short-lived credentials at the integration boundary
# User Auth (Internal): INF-22 | ADFS / SAML 2.0 over TLS 1.3 with MFA and signed assertions
# User Auth (External): Not applicable - employee-only platform / No external-user entry point
